repository-code: "https://github.com/myppqk88/Mapping-Open-Science-Policy-in-China"
abstract: >
  This repository provides the replication dataset and code for "Mapping Open
  Science Policy in China", comprising 21,242 clause-level open science policy
  entries extracted from 10,413 documents issued by Chinese central, provincial,
  and prefectural authorities between 1998 and 2026, together with a 27-year
  provincial science-and-technology innovation indicator panel and all scripts
  needed to reproduce every figure and table in the paper.
keywords:
  - open science
  - policy text analysis
  - China
  - scientometrics
  - policy intensity
  - structural breakpoint detection
  - entropy weight method
  - science and technology innovation
